       "w": 457,
       "h": 151,
       "kind": "text",
       "tag": "p",
       "text": "**Gathering References****:**\nI researched real-world amusement parks and piers alongside post-apocalyptic environments to shape the tone of an **abandoned, decaying carnival**. I focused on weathered wood, rusted metal, faded signage, and broken ride structures to ground the world in believable detail.",
       "font": {
        "f": "inter",
        "s": 18.0,
        "w": 400,
        "c": "fg",
        "lh": 1.2
       },
       "mt": 0,
       "dx": 0
      },
      {
       "w": 457,
       "h": 108,
       "kind": "text",
       "tag": "p",
       "text": "**Sketching:**\nEarly on, I used **simple top-down layouts and quick blockout sketches** to plan player flow, landmark placement, and zone pacing before moving into Unreal Engine.",
